# All text files are LF in the repo and on every checkout, regardless of the
# contributor's core.autocrlf (the Git for Windows installer default of true
# would otherwise convert on checkout and warn on every add). Zotero upstream
# expects LF; binaries are auto-detected. Verified 2026-08-27: the whole index
# was already LF, so this normalizes nothing retroactively.
* text=auto eol=lf
